<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44390" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐλογ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>good or fine language</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				400d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Lex.</u>
				1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>plausibility</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχει τινὰ εὐλογίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>CP</u>
					6.31.1
				</span></i>
			; <i>habet</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐλογίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cic.
					<u>Att.</u>
					13.22.4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Rom.</u>
				16.18
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τοῦ δόγματος εὐ</span>.
			prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Sign.</u>
				27
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ εὐ. τῶν πραγμάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Herc.</u>
					1251.8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>praise, eulogy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				4.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.42
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑμνῆσαι δι᾽ εὐλογίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>HF</u>
					356
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄξιος εὐλογίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pax</u>
					738
				</span></i>
			: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>I.</u>
				3.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6(5).21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ax.</u>
				365a
			</span></i>; <i>good fame, glory</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγήραντος εὐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Simon.
				100
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				5.24
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐλογίαν φέρει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Lyr.Alex.Adesp.</u>
					21.10
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχειν εὐ. τινὰ πρός τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					65.4
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii/iv A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> esp.<i>praise</i> to God, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Si.</u>
				50.20(22)
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Apoc.</u>
				7.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				74
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Egypt</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>act of blessing</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατάρα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ge.</u>
				27.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Jac.</u>
				3.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>blessing called down</i> or <i>bestowed</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Pr.</u>
				10.22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ep.Pet.</u>
				3.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>gift, bounty</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jo.</u>
				15.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>4 Ki.</u>
				5.15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>2 Ep.Cor.</u>
				9.5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ σπείρων ἐπ᾽ εὐλογίαις ἐπ᾽
				εὐλογίαις καὶ θερίσει</span>
			<i>bountifully</i>, ib. <i><span class="en">
				6
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.129
			</span></i>.</div>
